sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Psicólogo
  participant A as Auth/RBAC
  participant T as Tenant Scope
  participant C as Crypto
  participant D as MySQL
  P->>A: abrir paciente
  A-->>P: permission + role
  P->>T: patient_id + tenant_id
  T->>D: consulta escopada
  D-->>T: paciente
  P->>C: salvar SOAP
  C-->>P: content_enc
  P->>D: INSERT tenant_id + content_enc
